dbus: add DOMID authentication mechanism for OpenXT

OpenXT uses a D-Bus "DOMID" auth mechanism so service VMs can prove
their Xen domain id, plus GetConnectionDOMID / dbus_connection_get_domid
helpers. Rebased onto dbus 1.16 credentials (named struct fields,
pid_fd, unix_gids).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OpenXT]

